# Project specific
# Keep curated examples in input/images/, output/images/ and output/golly/.
# Ignore personal/presentation artifacts and locally generated exports.
notebooks/*.pdf
notebooks/*_thesis.*
notebooks/images_thesis.ipynb
input/images/jan.png
output/golly/jan.cells


